 "captions": [
  {
   "t0": 0.175,
   "t1": 1.61,
   "text": "One quarter closer.",
   "line": "ch2_hook"
  },
  {
   "t0": 1.63,
   "t1": 3.04,
   "text": "What changes first?",
   "line": "ch2_hook"
  },
  {
   "t0": 3.227,
   "t1": 5.002,
   "text": "One quarter of the way in.",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 5.022,
   "t1": 7.781,
   "text": "Three quarters of today's distance: about",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 7.801,
   "t1": 10.852,
   "text": "two hundred eighty-eight thousand kilometers.",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 10.872,
   "t1": 14.207,
   "text": "The Moon looks one and a third times wider.",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 14.227,
   "t1": 16.075,
   "text": "You'd notice it right away,",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 16.095,
   "t1": 18.377,
   "text": "like a coin held a little closer.",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 18.397,
   "t1": 21.307,
   "text": "Its light now takes about a second to reach you.",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 21.327,
   "t1": 25.157,
   "text": "Even so, there is one thing the sea already feels.",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 25.177,
   "t1": 27.004,
   "text": "The Moon's pull on the Earth",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 27.024,
   "t1": 28.937,
   "text": "gets stronger as it comes in.",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 28.957,
   "t1": 31.024,
   "text": "At this distance, its tidal pull",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 31.044,
   "t1": 33.392,
   "text": "is more than twice what it is today.",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 33.412,
   "t1": 36.202,
   "text": "Not enough to see on the beach, not yet.",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 36.222,
   "t1": 38.599,
   "text": "Today, the Sun pulls on the tides",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 38.619,
   "t1": 41.452,
   "text": "too, with about half the Moon's effect.",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 41.472,
   "t1": 43.821,
   "text": "Bring the Moon closer, and the Sun's",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 43.841,
   "t1": 46.737,
   "text": "share stays the same while the Moon's grows.",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 46.757,
   "t1": 49.617,
   "text": "So the Moon would take over even more.",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 49.782,
   "t1": 50.857,
   "text": "Still looking up?",
   "line": "cta2_follow"
  },
  {
   "t0": 50.877,
   "t1": 52.157,
   "text": "Tap like and follow.",
   "line": "cta2_follow"
  },
  {
   "t0": 52.177,
   "t1": 53.767,
   "text": "There's plenty more sky.",
   "line": "cta2_follow"
  },
  {
   "t0": 53.943,
   "t1": 55.888,
   "text": "But the number keeps falling, and",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 55.908,
   "t1": 57.933,
   "text": "the sea is about to start to move.",
   "line": "ch2_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 58.161,
   "t1": 61.631,
   "text": "Half the distance is where the water starts to climb.",
   "line": "ch2_loop"
  },
  {
   "t0": 61.762,
   "t1": 62.967,
   "text": "Part two of eight.",
   "line": "closer2"
  },
  {
   "t0": 62.987,
